---
source: crates/cli/src/redmod.rs
expression: help.output
---
Usage: redscript-cli transpile-redmod [-s <src...>] [--dependency <dependency...>] [-b <bundle>] -o <output> [--redmod <redmod>] [--game-root <game-root>] [--timeout <timeout>]

transpile community redscript sources as a new REDmod script package

Options:
  -s, --src         authored source file or directory to transpile (repeatable;
                    honors .redscript roots)
  --dependency      community source file or directory for analysis only
                    (repeatable)
  -b, --bundle      existing baseline .redscripts for engine symbols (replaces
                    built-in boot sources)
  -o, --output      new mod directory; parent must exist, name must not contain
                    periods
  --redmod          absolute path to a trusted official REDmod executable for
                    optional validation
  --game-root       absolute game installation root for base blobs (requires
                    --redmod)
  --timeout         official validation timeout in positive, finite seconds
                    (default: 60)
  --help, help      display usage information
